<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Secure checkout' }) %><body class="payment-page"><%- include('partials/navbar') %><main class="payment-shell" id="main-content"><a href="/listings/<%= listing._id %>" class="back-link"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'left', size: 17 }) %>Back to property</a><p class="eyebrow">ONE LAST STEP</p><h1>Complete your reservation</h1><p class="muted">A secure payment. A new place to call home.</p><section class="payment-summary"><div class="share-property"><img src="<%= photoFor(listing) %>" alt="<%= listing.title %>"><div><h2><%= listing.title %></h2><p><%= listing.location %>, <%= listing.country %></p></div></div><dl class="summary-list"><dt>Dates</dt><dd><%= attempt.checkIn %> — <%= attempt.checkOut %></dd><dt>Guests</dt><dd><%= attempt.guests %></dd><dt class="summary-total">Total (INR)</dt><dd class="summary-total"><%= money(attempt.totalPaise) %></dd></dl><p class="payment-environment"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'info', size: 15 }) %>Razorpay test mode · No real charge</p><p class="muted small">Your dates are confirmed after payment verification. If the stay becomes unavailable, the test payment is reversed.</p></section><details class="payment-test-help"><summary>How to complete a test payment</summary><ol><li>Use Chrome or Edge and allow the Razorpay bank authentication popup. For a test contact number, you can use <strong>9000090000</strong>.</li><li>Select <strong>Cards</strong> in Razorpay and use test card <strong>4100 2800 0000 1007</strong>.</li><li>Enter any cardholder name, CVV <strong>123</strong> and a future expiry such as <strong>12/30</strong>. Do not save the card.</li><li>On the test bank page, choose <strong>Success</strong>. If an OTP is requested, enter <strong>123456</strong> and submit.</li><li>Wait for the reservation confirmation. You can find the transaction in your Razorpay dashboard with <strong>Test mode</strong> selected.</li></ol><p class="muted small">A failed or closed bank window does not confirm a reservation. You can reopen checkout and retry. <a href="https://razorpay.com/docs/payments/payments/test-card-details/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Razorpay test card reference</a></p></details><button class="button button-primary full-width payment-launch" id="pay" data-key="<%= keyId %>" data-order="<%= attempt.orderId %>" data-amount="<%= attempt.totalPaise %>" data-title="<%= listing.title %>"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'lock', size: 17 }) %>Continue to Razorpay</button><p id="payment-status" role="status"></p><form id="payment-result" method="POST" action="/payments/verify"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="razorpay_order_id" value="<%= attempt.orderId %>"><input type="hidden" name="razorpay_payment_id"><input type="hidden" name="razorpay_signature"><button id="verify-payment" class="button button-outline full-width" type="submit" hidden>Retry payment verification</button></form><p class="secure-note"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'shield', size: 16 }) %>Payment details are handled securely by Razorpay.</p></main><%- include('partials/footer') %><script src="https://checkout.razorpay.com/v1/checkout.js" defer></script><script src="/js/payment.js" defer></script></body></html>
